<title>POLAND: WARTA TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 45.6.</title>
<headline>WARTA TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 45.6.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 87,700 shares in TUiR Warta SA at 45.6 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Monday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Warta was trading at 46.4 zlotys in 1,941 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
